### UniProt

UniProt (Universal Protein Resource) is a comprehensive database of protein sequences and functional annotations. It contains both manually
reviewed (Swiss-Prot) and computationally annotated (TrEMBL) entries, providing information on protein function, domains, localization,
and sequence features. In this project, UniProt was used to retrieve protein sequences in FASTA format and obtain functional information
required for protein characterization, structure prediction, and other downstream bioinformatics analyses.
